    "Description": "Hi HN, Sanchit here from RunAnywhere (YC W26). We just open-sourced TrnRT: Trainium RunTime, our inference engine for AWS Trainium. We started 3 weeks back, and currently we\u2019re able to serve and run GLM 5.3 flash (FP8) on AWS trn2.48xlarge, and will bring more models support soon. It\u2019s open to contributions :)\u003Cp\u003EWhat it does today:\u003Cp\u003E- Serves 2 instances of GLM-5.3 flash on a single box, 8 trn2 with a cache aware router.\u003Cp\u003E- Can process 3.57M TPM (tokens per minute) on SemiAnalysis\u0026#x27;s AgentX",
